+# CVE-2026-74746 — Netfilter flowtable partially published flow use-after-free
+
+Reviewed 2026-10-19. This dossier assesses the tenant-configured networking path; it is not a claim about every host service or every historical node configuration. The per-node evaluation is a separate evidence product.
+
+## Primary defect and evidence strength
+
+flow_offload_add published the original-direction tuple before the reply tuple. Garbage collection treats original tuples as owners, so it could observe and free a flow while reply insertion still used it. The correction inserts the reply first and GC-visible original last, with matching error cleanup. The report describes KASAN read/write failures through flowtable/rhashtable operations.
+
+The primary report establishes UAF read/write behavior but no complete platform exploit or kernel execution.
+
+Linux CNA cvssV3_1: 9.8 (CRITICAL), `CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H`. The score and any CNA scenario assertions are source attribution, not a demonstrated vpsAdminOS escape or a substitute for the prerequisite analysis.
+
+## Introduction, stable fixes and exceptions
+
+The primary Linux CNA record places the global introduction at **4.16.0**, commit [`ac2a66665e231847cab11b8c8e844ce43207dd2e`](https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/commit/?id=ac2a66665e231847cab11b8c8e844ce43207dd2e), and the mainline fix at **7.2.0**, commit [`2014ac62df9d45bb9a004a043e85df7be09ed780`](https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/commit/?id=2014ac62df9d45bb9a004a043e85df7be09ed780). The 6.12 correction is [`972fdf7c4f5c282a239c88fea614b056c33dc025`](https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/972fdf7c4f5c282a239c88fea614b056c33dc025) in **6.12.105**.
+
+| Branch | Affected from, inclusive | Fixed from, exclusive boundary | Corrective commit |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| 4.19 | 4.19.0 | open-ended; no same-branch fix listed | not listed |
+| 5.4 | 5.4.0 | open-ended; no same-branch fix listed | not listed |
+| 5.10 | 5.10.0 | 5.10.266 | [0a00254585827f1695aa2700114af622ea754cfa](https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0a00254585827f1695aa2700114af622ea754cfa) |
+| 5.15 | 5.15.0 | 5.15.217 | [be345dcbddb4643a54252b954af974b16eda8f91](https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/be345dcbddb4643a54252b954af974b16eda8f91) |
+| 6.1 | 6.1.0 | 6.1.184 | [211ee5d998d92a7d548811939c65942d06c146e4](https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/211ee5d998d92a7d548811939c65942d06c146e4) |
