+
+
+The exact archived6.12.95 build cannot execute this MPTCP path because the
+subsystem is absent. On enabled kernels, the reviewed primary descriptions
+establish connection-state inconsistency, possible stale/uninitialized fields
+and warnings/connection failure; CNA scenarios discuss stronger integrity and
+confidentiality consequences. A complete VPS-root, host-root or cross-VPS exploit
+is not established by the reviewed primary record and patch. These negative
+statements are limited to those sources, not production-exploitation evidence.
