+## Platform prerequisites, exact source and roles
+
+XFRM netlink control checks netlink_net_capable(CAP_NET_ADMIN), so tenant user/network namespace administration can configure its own security associations and deletion without initial-userns authority. LXC default seccomp does not block the relevant networking or io_uring calls. XFRM/XFRM_USER are built in; ESP4/ESP6, XFRM_INTERFACE and XFRM_USER_COMPAT are built in in the exact .95 configuration. VTI is a module and optional modules must be separately available where required. Alternate XFRM-interface or max-depth paths prevent requiring VTI as a universal gate. IPV6_MIP6=m compiles receive call sites through IS_ENABLED but the mip6 module registers required destination/routing XFRM types; it is absent from preload and autoload defaults off. Actual loaded types, cryptographic algorithm, packet state,32-bit compatibility workloads and zerocopy mode are candidate-specific predicates. Storage backup/NFS workloads do not establish tenant-configured IPsec, so roles are node only.
+
